38014>>>>>        End
38014>>>>>>
38014>>>>>        Else Begin
38015>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to True
38016>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to True
38017>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to bHasRecord
38018>>>>>        End
38018>>>>>>
38018>>>>>    End_Procedure
